  <item><title>Ruth wearing a winter uniform</title><guid>https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/ac8myub0zejw57nzj97wn/xEhDXKGcgR_2026-Sep-05.webp?rlkey=3qpwa5tt5yt3d30a84lj5c5xz&amp;raw=1</guid><link>https://kiwimeowo.neocities.org/art/2026.html</link><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/ac8myub0zejw57nzj97wn/xEhDXKGcgR_2026-Sep-05.webp?rlkey=3qpwa5tt5yt3d30a84lj5c5xz&amp;raw=1"><p>Bakatako prompt: Your Favourite Season; Did the prompt again for the Encore quest. Currently, autumn is my favourite season, not too hot, not too cold. What I love about it is when autumn barely has started, the cool breeze and gentle sunlight feels especially good. Shame that lasts very short, and winter immediately beats you up. Also here's Ruth wearing a winter uniform. <span class='blogdate'>(5 Sep 2026)</span></p>]]></description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 04:24:19 GMT</pubDate></item>